
Alice:

A gecko in human
form - fast, and
very hard to kill.
She looks small
enough to snap, but
nobody here is
quicker on her feet.
Strength was never
her gift. Instead
she goes where she
isn't seen, and
notices what the
rest of us walk
straight past.
A wallet lifted, a
lock talked open, a
quiet exit - none of
it costs those
fingers a thought.
